AW-GRIP MOBILE HOLDER\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"BOBO BM4 JAW-GRIP SECURITY - If you are looking for a compact yet secure bike mount for your mobile phone, this is what you should get. Jaw-Grip expands to fit a wide range of phones from 4.0 - 7.0 inch screen, while keeping all of your buttons and ports accessible. 1 YEAR WARRANTY: We provide 1 YEAR replacement warranty for any kind of manufacturing defect or any component failure, except for wear and tear which may happen due to usage. Any issue regarding this bike mount, we will take full responsibility. Feel free to purchase and test the unit out. If you are not satisfied for ANY reason, we will make things right!\\\",\\\"priceRange\\\":{\\\"minVariantPrice\\\":{\\\"amount\\\":\\\"1250.0\\\",\\\"currencyCode\\\":\\\"INR\\\"}},\\\"images\\\":[{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-004-001001.webp?v=1787060359\\\",\\\"altText\\\":\\\"BOBO BM4 JAW-GRIP MOBILE HOLDER\\\"},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-004-4.webp?v=1787060359\\\",\\\"altText\\\":\\\"BOBO BM4 JAW-GRIP MOBILE HOLDER\\\"},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-004-2.webp?v=1787060359\\\",\\\"altText\\\":\\\"BOBO BM4 JAW-GRIP MOBILE HOLDER\\\"},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-004-1.webp?v=1787060359\\\",\\\"altText\\\":\\\"BOBO BM4 JAW-GRIP MOBILE HOLDER\\\"}],\\\"variants\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52881018159421\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Default Title\\\",\\\"price\\\":{\\\"amount\\\":\\\"1250.0\\\",\\\"currencyCode\\\":\\\"INR\\\"},\\\"compareAtPrice\\\":{\\\"amount\\\":\\\"2200.0\\\",\\\"currencyCode\\\":\\\"INR\\\"},\\\"availableForSale\\\":true,\\\"quantityAvailable\\\":null}],\\\"brand\\\":\\\"Primo Customs\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Accessories\\\",\\\"compatibility\\\":[],\\\"specifications\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Brand\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Primo Customs\\\"},{