image\",\"content\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/phone-holder-for-bike.png?v=1787079375\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"Phone Holders\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Irani MotoHub | Premium Motorcycle Performance Parts\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Premium Motorcycle accessories and performance upgrades\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://iranimotohub.in/hero-bg.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"12\",{\"rel\":\"shortcut icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"13\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?favicon.1-ypg-tqme8hc.ico\",\"sizes\":\"1024x1024\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"14\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"15\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2c\",\"16\",{}]]\n2d:I[12371,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2wh3bu9ub4p8d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2bmv3ihep17gq.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3cichi1mg1ftc.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3whgfyvaz15fw.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0q6ibp_bkaa1-.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3j-4ruzks89pv.js\"],\"default\"]\n2e:T873,18 Months Warranty : This mobile holder comes with 18 Months warranty. Its warranty includes any kind of manufacturing defect or any component failure, except wear & tear. a warranty card will be issued to you at the time of purchase for easy replacement. You can directly contact through our WhatsApp number i.e.8899-640-640 and claim it when needed for warranty. For more details, kindly visit the warranty tab on the Product Details Page. 360° Rotation: As its name suggests, this mobile holder can revolve at a 360° angle which means one can use it at any angle. It no longer impacts your vision since one can adjust as per his angle of vision and position due to its flexibility. One Hand Operation: This super grip mobile holder is designed in such a way to ease its users. This device can be operated with a single hand and one can focus on ride with the other hand. Just rotate the knob on the right hand side and it is ready to use conveniently. Supports Upto 7.0 Inches Screen: This mobile holder comes with a more unique feature. One has not to purchase this product as per his mobile type; rather its universal feature expands it to fit an android phone or an iPhone. May it be 4.0 inches screen or 7.0 inches screen, keeping all your ports accessible. Just rotate the knob anticlockwise to increase the width and clockwise to decrease the width of the grip. OEM Grade Components Used: The components used in this product are high grade components. There is no compromise with the quality of the product. Before packing, each and every component and product is tested at different stages to make sure it is working efficiently. All Tools & Spare Parts Included: There is a REARVIEW MIRROR MOUNT (specially for scooters). Also, there is a 32MM diameter METAL BUCKLE for bike handlebar which is also available in other sizes like 22, 25 MM. and one ALLEN KEY (size 4) these are very useful to tighten/loosen the handlebar. Perfectly Mount On both Bikes & Scooters: This universal mobile holder is designed in a way to meet the needs of both a bike rider as well as a Scooty rider. This unique feature makes it perfectly fit on both bikes and scooters.2f:T510,Riders today need a navigation device on their bike to follow their designated routes.When you are riding a motorbike, the mobile holder keeps the smartphone steady on the spot.It helps to navigate the apps and travel to the destination easily.The phone attached to the mobile stand acts as a GPS device.This creates a need for a proper mobile holder on the bike which can serve the purpose of holding the mobile firmly during long trips, proper position as per the angle of the rider etc.Waterproof mobile holder protects your phone in wet conditions.A wireless/cordless charger is a type of wireless power transfer.It uses electro magnetic induction to provide power to the portable device.Inductive charges transfer energy through inductive coupling.A moving electric charge creates a magnetic field, which fluctuates in strength as the amplitude of the electric current fluctuates.Finally the DC current charges the battery or provides operating power. Note: Always select appropriate handle mount spacer 22 MM/ 25 MM according to your bike handle diameter to avoid damages Do not place handle mount on curvy areas of handle bar. ⇒ Package Contents : Mobile Holder (1 nos.) Mount T1 (1 nos.) Mount T2 ( 1 nos.) Allen Key (1 nos.) Fuse (2 nos.) Thank you Card (1 nos.) Warranty Card (1 nos.)30:Tc94,Quadlock® 12-24V Waterproof Wireless Charging Head The Quad Lock® 12-24V Waterproof Wireless Charging Head (QLH-HW-WCH-2) is designed for motorcycle riders who want to conveniently charge their phone while on the go, even in harsh weather conditions. Key Features: Secure Mounting: Features a dual-stage twist lock, ensuring your phone is securely mounted to your motorcycle, even in rugged terrain. No worries about your phone falling off during your ride. Weather Resistant: With an IP67 water-resistant rating, this wireless charging head is highly durable and capable of withstanding rain, mud, and other tough conditions, so you can ride confidently without worrying about the weather. The aluminum rear housing and glass-filled nylon front ensure long-lasting protection against the elements. Convenient Wireless Charging: Use GPS navigation listen to music, and stay connected without worrying about your phone’s battery running out. The Wireless Charging Head allows you to charge your phone wirelessly while mounted on your motorcycle. Charging Output : 5W, 7.5W, 10W, or 15W depending on your device: Apple devices charge up to 7.5W Samsung Galaxy devices (S7 and newer) charge up to 10W Google Pixel devices (Pixel 5 and newer) charge up to 15W Easy Installation (Professional Installation Recommended): Includes a 1.5m hardwired cable with fly leads for easy wiring. The charger should be connected to the ignition positive (not a steady positive) or an isolator switch, with the correct in-line 3A fuse to avoid battery drain. Note: Professional installation is recommended for optimal performance. Charging Status Indicator: A Red LED light indicates when the charger is active and charging. What’s Included: 1 x Quad Lock® 12V-24V Waterproof Wireless Charging Head 1.5m hardwired cable with fly leads for power connection 2 x Cable grommet plugs 1 x 3mm hex (Allen) key 1 x M5 x 35mm Countersunk hex socket screw 5 x 5mm x 200mm nylon zip ties for securing cables Technical Specifications: Input: hardwired to a 12V or 24V battery Output : 5W, 7.5W, 10W, 15W (depending on device compatibility) iPhone devices charge up to 7.5W Samsung Galaxy devices charge up to 10W Google Pixel devices charge up to 15W IP67 Water-Resistant Rating Suitable for wet weather conditions. LED Ligh: Re-indicator for charging status. Dual Stage Lock EnEnsuresecure mounting even on rough terrain. Mount Compatibility: Compatible with all Quad Lock® Motorcycle Mounts and accessories. Compatible with all Quad Lock 360™ Arms, Bases, and Accessories. Device Compatibility: iPhone (from iPhone 8 to iPhone 16 Pro Max, including SE models) Samsung Galaxy (from S8 to S25 Ultra, including Note series) Google Pixel (from Pixel 3 to Pixel 9 Pro) Huawei (P30 Pro, P40 Pro) Important Notes: Not compatible with Universal Adaptors. This charger must be installed via ignition positive or isolator switch with the correct in-line fuse to avoid battery drain. Professional installation is highly recommended to ensure safety and proper wiring. The 12V-24V Waterproof Wireless Charging Head is the perfect solution for motorcycle riders who want to stay connected and powered up while riding, no matter the weather conditions.24:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://iranimotohub.in\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Phone Holders\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://iranimotohub.in/collections/phone-holders\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"handle\":\"phone-holders\",\"initialCollection\":{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555261919549\",\"handle\":\"phone-holders\",\"title\":\"Phone Holders\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/phone-holder-for-bike.png?v=1787079375\",\"altText\":\"Phone Holders\"}},\"initialCollections\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555260772669\",\"handle\":\"air-filters\",\"title\":\"Air Filters\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/air-filter-bike.png?v=1787078101\",\"altText\":\"Air Filters\"}},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555261559101\",\"handle\":\"premium-mirrors\",\"title\":\"Premium Mirrors\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_12.15.38_AM.jpg?v=1787078767\",\"altText\":\"Premium Mirrors\"}},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555261591869\",\"handle\":\"chain-kits\",\"title\":\"Chain Kits\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/chain-sprocket-bike-only-one.png?v=1787078895\",\"altText\":\"Chain Kits\"}},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555261624637\",\"handle\":\"tank-pads-grips\",\"title\":\"Tank Pads & Grips\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/tank-grip-for-bike-on