nt/52881018159421\",\"title\":\"Default Title\",\"price\":{\"amount\":\"1250.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"compareAtPrice\":{\"amount\":\"2200.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"availableForSale\":true,\"quantityAvailable\":null}],\"brand\":\"Primo Customs\",\"category\":\"Accessories\",\"compatibility\":[],\"specifications\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Primo Customs\"},{\"name\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Accessories\"}],\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"rev-default-1\",\"author\":\"Verified Rider\",\"rating\":5,\"date\":\"2026-06-01\",\"title\":\"Genuine product\",\"comment\":\"Shipped fast, original packing. Performance is exactly as advertised.\"}],\"rating\":4.7,\"hp_gain\":\"$undefined\",\"weight_saved\":\"$undefined\",\"safety_rating\":\"$undefined\",\"tags\":[],\"metafields\":{\"custom\":{\"hp_gain\":\"$undefined\",\"weight_saved\":\"$undefined\",\"safety_rating\":\"$undefined\"}},\"inventoryQuantity\":\"$undefined\",\"inventoryTracked\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Product/10473566732605\",\"handle\":\"bobo-bm17h-anti-vibration-anti-theft-motorcycle-mobile-mount\",\"title\":\"Bobo BM17H Anti Vibration Anti Theft Motorcycle Mobile Mount\",\"description\":\"BOBO BM17H (or BM17M) ANTI-VIBRATION ANTI-THEFT – Ultra strong mount, with anti-vibration shock absorbers and anti-theft double socket arm ALWAYS SECURED – The clean and clever design sports great holding power without hiding your smartphone behind foam pads and silicon bands. It will ensure you trust the product and believe that your phone will never come off, even on the bumpiest of the roads. EASY TO INSTALL DO-IT-YOURSELF – We provide all required tools and spare parts to help you install the mount on your own, without any external help. ALL TOOLS & SPARE PARTS INCLUDED – Along with the main unit with PRO Vibration Damper, we provide: In BM17H PRO: 1) BUCKLE & SPACERS – We support 4 common sizes of handlebar diameter i.e. 12, 22, 25, and 32 mm; 2) Anti-Theft Double Socket Arm; 3) 2 different size HEX KEYs\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\"amount\":\"2599.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"}},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-017-101001.webp?v=1787060358\",\"altText\":\"Bobo BM17H Anti Vibration Anti Theft Motorcycle Mobile Mount\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-017-101001-3.webp?v=1787060358\",\"altText\":\"Bobo BM17H Anti Vibration Anti Theft Motorcycle Mobile Mount\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-017-101001-5.webp?v=1787060358\",\"altText\":\"Bobo BM17H Anti Vibration Anti Theft Motorcycle Mobile Mount\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-017-101001-2.webp?v=1787060358\",\"altText\":\"Bobo BM17H Anti Vibration Anti Theft Motorcycle Mobile Mount\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-017-101001-6.webp?v=1787060358\",\"altText\":\"Bobo BM17H Anti Vibration Anti Theft Motorcycle Mobile Mount\"}],\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52881018126653\",\"title\":\"Default Title\",\"price\":{\"amount\":\"2599.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"compareAtPrice\":null,\"availableForSale\":true,\"quantityAvailable\":null}],\"brand\":\"Primo Customs\",\"category\":\"Accessories\",\"compatibility\":[],\"specifications\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Primo Customs\"},{\"name\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Accessories\"}],\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"rev-default-1\",\"author\":\"Verified Rider\",\"rating\":5,\"date\":\"2026-06-01\",\"title\":\"Genuine product\",\"comment\":\"Shipped fast, original packing. Performance is exactly as advertised.\"}],\"rating\":4.7,\"hp_gain\":\"$undefined\",\"weight_saved\":\"$undefined\",\"safety_rating\":\"$undefined\",\"tags\":[],\"metafields\":{\"custom\":{\"hp_gain\":\"$undefined\",\"weight_saved\":\"$undefined\",\"safety_rating\":\"$undefined\"}},\"inventoryQuantity\":\"$undefined\",\"inventoryTracked\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Product/10473566667069\",\"handle\":\"simtac-wireless-charging-mobile-holder\",\"title\":\"SIMTAC WIRELESS CHARGING MOBILE HOLDER\",\"description\":\"Riders today need a navigation device on their bike to follow their designated routes.When you are riding a motorbike, the mobile holder keeps the smartphone steady on the spot.It helps to navigate the apps and travel to the destination easily.The phone attached to the mobile stand acts as a GPS device.This creates a need for a proper mobile holder on the bike which can serve the purpose of holding the mobile firmly during long trips, proper position as per the angle of the rider etc.Waterproof mobile holder protects your phone in wet conditions.A wireless/cordless charger is a type of wireless power transfer.It uses electro magnetic induction to provide power to the portable device.Inductive charges transfer energy through inductive coupling.A moving electric charge creates a magnetic field, which fluctuates in strength as the amplitude of the electric current fluctuates.Finally the DC current charges the battery or provides operating power\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\"amount\":\"2649.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"}},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/5F18FE1F-973F-40B0-9821-1668D86F10D9.jpg?v=1787060356\",\"altText\":\"SIMTAC WIRELESS CHARGING MOBILE HOLDER\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/38E1DE2D-5C7B-40CD-8566-225208D58B76.jpg?v=1787060356\",\"altText\":\"SIMTAC WIRELESS CHARGING MOBILE HOLDER\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/6C98B394-2965-4B68-A2CE-1F16B6D71197.png?v=1787060356\",\"altText\":\"SIMTAC WIRELESS CHARGING MOBILE HOLDER\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/8BB11EAD-87F5-480F-9B7D-FB1B40E130EC.png?v=1787060356\",\"altText\":\"SIMTAC WIRELESS CHARGING MOBILE HOLDER\"}],\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52881018061