 grip with vibration damper (MH02-PRO)\"}],\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52881017930045\",\"title\":\"Default Title\",\"price\":{\"amount\":\"1249.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"compareAtPrice\":{\"amount\":\"2599.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"availableForSale\":true,\"quantityAvailable\":null}],\"brand\":\"Primo Customs\",\"category\":\"Accessories\",\"compatibility\":[],\"specifications\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Primo Customs\"},{\"name\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Accessories\"}],\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"rev-default-1\",\"author\":\"Verified Rider\",\"rating\":5,\"date\":\"2026-06-01\",\"title\":\"Genuine product\",\"comment\":\"Shipped fast, original packing. Performance is exactly as advertised.\"}],\"rating\":4.7,\"hp_gain\":\"$undefined\",\"weight_saved\":\"$undefined\",\"safety_rating\":\"$undefined\",\"tags\":[],\"metafields\":{\"custom\":{\"hp_gain\":\"$undefined\",\"weight_saved\":\"$undefined\",\"safety_rating\":\"$undefined\"}},\"inventoryQuantity\":\"$undefined\",\"inventoryTracked\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Product/10473566503229\",\"handle\":\"simtac-splash-guard-x-with-vibration-damper-and-wireless-charger-mhwpwc-pro\",\"title\":\"Simtac splash guard X with vibration damper and wireless charger (MHWPWC-PRO)\",\"description\":\"Simtac Splash Guard X MHWPWC-PRO is a high-performance waterproof mobile holder featuring built-in wireless charging, USB-C connectivity, and an advanced vibration damper. Built for adventurers and daily commuters alike, it offers full phone protection, firm grip, and seamless charging—delivering convenience and reliability on every ride. Note: Always select appropriate handle mount spacer 22 MM/ 25 MM according to your bike handle diameter to avoid damages Do not place handle mount on curvy areas of handle bar. ⇒ Package Contents : Mobile Holder (1 nos.) Handle Mount (1 nos.) Allen Key (1 nos.) Thank you Card (1 nos.) Warranty Card (1 nos.)\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\