R HOLDER\",\"description\":\"BOBO BM1 Jaw Grip 3.0 USB Charger Holder – Key Features: Universal Fit: Holds phones up to 6.7 inches. Jaw Grip: Ensures a firm hold on rough terrains. 360° Rotation: Adjustable viewing angles. USB Charging: Fast-charging port for on-the-go power. Weatherproof: Dust & rain-resistant design. Easy Install: Handlebar clamp with anti-slip grip. 🔋 Stay secure and powered with the BOBO BM1 Jaw Grip 3.0 – perfect for every ride!\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\"amount\":\"1799.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"}},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/1_3f0fb570-3d7d-4c6d-b93f-b3bbca06f144.png?v=1787060361\",\"altText\":\"BOBO BM1 JAW GRIP 3.0 USB CHARGER HOLDER\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/2_f80eead3-ba47-4289-8700-9b6d2f51e352.png?v=1787060361\",\"altText\":\"BOBO BM1 JAW GRIP 3.0 USB CHARGER HOLDER\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_f8a0aaaf-7a8a-4920-98c2-a7d744aa15b2.webp?v=1787060361\",\"altText\":\"BOBO BM1 JAW GRIP 3.0 USB CHARGER HOLDER\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_55f9b30d-160a-455a-8620-c6dd7d20f9d4.webp?v=1787060361\",\"altText\":\"BOBO BM1 JAW GRIP 3.0 USB CHARGER HOLDER\"}],\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52881018224957\",\"title\":\"Default Title\",\"price\":{\"amount\":\"1799.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"compareAtPrice\":{\"amount\":\"1999.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"availableForSale\":true,\"quantityAvailable\":null}],\"brand\":\"Primo Customs\",\"category\":\"Bike Accessories\",\"compatibility\":[\"mobile holder\"],\"specifications\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Primo Customs\"},{\"name\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Bike Accessories\"}],\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"rev-default-1\",\"author\":\"Verified Rider\",\"rating\":5,\"date\":\"2026-06-01\",\"title\":\"Genuine product\",\"comment\":\"Shipped fast, original packing. Performance is exactly as advertised.\"}],\"rating\":4.7,\"tags\":[\"mobile holder\"],\"metafields\":{\"custom\":{}}},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Product/10473566765373\",\"handle\":\"bobo-bm4-jaw-grip-bike-cycle-phone-holder-motorcycle-mobile-mount\",\"title\":\"BOBO BM4 JAW-GRIP MOBILE HOLDER\",\"description\":\"BOBO BM4 JAW-GRIP SECURITY - If you are looking for a compact yet secure bike mount for your mobile phone, this is what you should get. Jaw-Grip expands to fit a wide range of phones from 4.0 - 7.0 inch screen, while keeping all of your buttons and ports accessible. 1 YEAR WARRANTY: We provide 1 YEAR replacement warranty for any kind of manufacturing defect or any component failure, except for wear and tear which may happen due to usage. Any issue regarding this bike mount, we will take full responsibility. Feel free to purchase and test the unit out. If you are not satisfied for ANY reason, we will make things right!\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\"amount\":\"1250.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"}},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-004-001001.webp?v=1787060359\",\"altText\":\"BOBO BM4 JAW-GRIP MOBILE HOLDER\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-004-4.webp?v=1787060359\",\"altText\":\"BOBO BM4 JAW-GRIP MOBILE HOLDER\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-004-2.webp?v=1787060359\",\"altText\":\"BOBO BM4 JAW-GRIP MOBILE HOLDER\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-004-1.webp?v=1787060359\",\"altText\":\"BOBO BM4 JAW-GRIP MOBILE HOLDER\"}],\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52881018159421\",\"title\":\"Default Title\",\"price\":{\"amount\":\"1250.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"compareAtPrice\":{\"amount\":\"2200.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"availableForSale\":true,\"quantityAvailable\":null}],\"brand\":\"Primo Customs\",\"category\":\"Accessories\",\"compatibility\":[],\"specifications\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Primo Customs\"},{\"name\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Accessories\"}],\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"rev-default-1\",\"author\":\"Verified Rider\",\"rating\":5,\"date\":\"2026-06-01\",\"title\":\"Genuine product\",\"comment\":\"Shipped fast, original packing. Performance is exactly as advertised.\"}],\"rating\":4.7,\"tags\":[],\"metafields\":{\"custom\":{}}},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Product/10473566732605\",\"handle\":\"bobo-bm17h-anti-vibration-anti-theft-motorcycle-mobile-mount\",\"title\":\"Bobo BM17H Anti Vibration Anti Theft Motorcycle Mobile Mount\",\"description\":\"BOBO BM17H (or BM17M) ANTI-VIBRATION ANTI-THEFT – Ultra strong mount, with anti-vibration shock absorbers and anti-theft double socket arm ALWAYS SECURED – The clean and clever design sports great holding power without hiding your smartphone behind foam pads and silicon bands. It will ensure you trust the product and believe that your phone will never come off, even on the bumpiest of the roads. EASY TO INSTALL DO-IT-YOURSELF – We provide all required tools and spare parts to help you install the mount on your own, without any external help. ALL TOOLS & SPARE PARTS INCLUDED – Along with the main unit with PRO Vibration Damper, we provide: In BM17H PRO: 1) BUCKLE & SPACERS – We support 4 common sizes of handlebar diameter i.e. 12, 22, 25, and 32 mm; 2) Anti-Theft Double Socket Arm; 3) 2 different size HEX KEYs\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\"amount\":\"2599.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"}},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-017-101001.webp?v=1787060358\",\"altText\":\"Bobo BM17H Anti Vibration Anti Theft Motorcycle Mobile Mount\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-017-101001-3.webp?v=1787060358\",\"altText\":\"Bobo BM17H Anti Vibration Anti Theft Motorcycle Mobile Mount\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-017-101001-5.webp?v=1787060358\",\"altText\":\"Bobo BM17H Anti Vibration Anti Theft Motorcycle Mobile Mount\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-017-101001-2.webp?v=1787060358\",\"altText\":\"Bobo BM17H Anti Vibration Anti Theft Motorcycle Mobile Mount\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/BB-BM-017-101001-6.webp?v=1787060358\",\"altText\":\"Bobo BM17H Anti Vibration Anti Theft Motorcycle Mobile Mount\"}],\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52881018126653\",\"title\":\"Default Title\",\"price\":{\"amount\":\"2599.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"compareAtPrice\":null,\"availableForSale\":true,\"quantityAvailable\":null}],\"brand\":\"Primo Customs\",\"category\":\"Accessories\",\"compatibility\":[],\"specifications\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Primo Customs\"},{\"name\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Accessories\"}],\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"rev-default-1\",\"author\":\"Verified Rider\",\"rating\":5,\"date\":\"2026-06-01\",\"title\":\"Genuine product\",\"comment\":\"Shipped fast, original packing. Performance is exactly as advertised.\"}],\"rating\":4.7,\"tags\":[],\"metafields\":{\"custom\":{}}},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Product/10473566667069\",\"handle\":\"simtac-wireless-charging-mobile-holder\",\"title\":\"SIMTAC WIRELESS CHARGING MOBILE HOLDER\",\"description\":\"Riders today need a navigation device on their bike to follow their designated routes.When you are riding a motorbike, the mobile holder keeps the smartphone steady on the spot.It helps to navigate the apps and travel to the destination easily.The phone attached to the mobile stand acts as a GPS device.This creates a need for a proper mobile holder on the bike which can serve the purpose of holding the mobile firmly during long trips, proper position as per the angle of the rider etc.Waterproof mobile holder protects your phone in wet conditions.A wireless/cordless charger is a type of wireless power transfer.It uses electro magnetic induction to provide power to the portable device.Inductive charges transfer energy through inductive coupling.A moving electric charge creates a magnetic field, which fluctuates in strength as the amplitude of the electric current fluctuates.Finally the DC current charges the battery or provides operating power\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\"amount\":\"2649.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"}},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/5F18FE1F-973F-40B0-9821-1668D86F10D9.jpg?v=1787060356\",\"altText\":\"SIMTAC WIRELESS CHARGING MOBILE HOLDER\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/38E1DE2D-5C7B-40CD-8566-225208D58B76.jpg?v=1787060356\",\"altText\":\"SIMTAC WIRELESS CHARGING MOBILE HOLDER\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/6C98B394-2965-4B68-A2CE-1F16B6D71197.png?v=1787060356\",\"altText\":\"SIMTAC WIRELESS CHARGING MOBILE HOLDER\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/8BB11EAD-87F5-480F-9B7D-FB1B40E130EC.png?v=1787060356\",\"altText\":\"SIMTAC WIRELESS CHARGING MOBILE HOLDER\"}],\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52881018061117\",\"title\":\"Default Title\",\"price\":{\"amount\":\"2649.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"compareAtPrice\":{\"amount\":\"7000.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"availableForSale\":true,\"quantityAvailable\":null}],\"brand\":\"Primo Customs\",\"category\":\"Accessories\",\"compatibility\":[\"PHONE HOLDER\"],\"specifications\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Primo Customs\"},{\"name\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Accessories\"}],\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"rev-default-1\",\"author\":\"Verified Rider\",\"rating\":5,\"date\":\"2026-06-01\",\"title\":\"Genuine product\",\"comment\":\"Shipped fast, original packing. Performance is exactly as advertised.\"}],\"rating\":4.7,\"tags\":[\"PHONE HOLDER\"],\"metafields\":{\"custom\":{}}},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Product/10473566634301\",\"handle\":\"simtac-waterproof-holder\",\"title\":\"Simtac Waterproof  Holder\",\"description\":\"Riders today need a navigation device on their bike to follow their designated routes.When you are riding a motorbike, the mobile holder keeps the smartphone steady on the spot.It helps to navigate the apps and travel to the destination easily.The phone attached to the mobile stand acts as a GPS device.This creates a need for a proper mobile holder on the bike which can serve the purpose of holding the mobile firmly during long trips, proper position as per the angle of the rider etc.Waterproof mobile holder protects your phone in wet conditions.\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\"amount\":\"1649.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"}},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/28772230-6F15-4D7A-8FC0-DF87F06DE2F0.jpg?v=1787060355\",\"altText\":\"Simtac Waterproof  Holder\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/52D4E152-F13D-4368-8877-91B5587497D0.jpg?v=1787060355\",\"altText\":\"Simtac Waterproof  Holder\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/405F17EA-FE7F-42DF-917C-8903FD934A28.jpg?v=1787060355\",\"altText\":\"Simtac Waterproof  Holder\"}],\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52881018028349\",\"title\":\"Default Title\",\"price\":{\"amount\":\"1649.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"compareAtPrice\":{\"amount\":\"3600.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"availableForSale\":true,\"quantityAvailable\":null}],\"brand\":\"Primo Customs\",\"category\":\"Bike Accessories\",\"compatibility\":[\"PHONE HOLDER\"],\"specifications\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Primo Customs\"},{\"name\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Bike Accessories\"}],\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"rev-default-1\",\"author\":\"Verified Rider\",\"rating\":5,\"date\":\"2026-06-01\",\"title\":\"Genuine product\",\"comment\":\"Shipped fast, original packing. Performance is exactly as advertised.\"}],\"rating\":4.7,\"tags\":[\"PHONE HOLDER\"],\"metafields\":